**
** Pressures of *DLOAD on the faces of an element set and of an element, read from this inp file alone.
** Body A is a cantilever of 4 C3D8 elements fixed at x=0, with the pressure 0.1 on the top faces (P2, z=1)
** and 0.2 on the end face of element 4 (P4, x=4). Body B is a unit cube of 2 C3D15 elements fixed at
** the bottom, whose midside nodes hecmw1 reorders, with the pressure 0.3 on the top faces (P2) and 0.4 on
** the face y=0 of element 11 (P3). A positive pressure pushes the face into the element, so that the
** loads sum to (-0.2, 0, -0.4) on body A and (0, 0.4, -0.3) on body B.
**
